    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13054" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολεπτ-ύνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fine down,</i> esp. <i>of reducing temperature</i>
			or <i>fever,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.695e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i> Trall.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Febr.</u>
				5
			</span></i>:—more freq. in 
				Pass.
			, <i>become quite fine</i> or <i>thin,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολεπτυνθέντος τοῦ πικροῦ</span>”
				<i>being fined away,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					83b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάτος ἀπολελεπτυσμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					489b33
				</span></i>
			; of fever, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.25
			</span></i>.</div>
